    <unit id="AlwaysOn">
      <segment>
        <source>Always-on VPN</source>
        <target state="translated">永久連線的 VPN</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="AlwaysOnHint">
      <segment>
        <source>To keep apps blocked even if NetworkControl stops, turn on "Always-on VPN" and "Block connections without VPN" for NetworkControl in system settings.</source>
        <target state="translated">若要在 NetworkControl 停止時仍阻擋應用程式，請在系統設定中為 NetworkControl 開啟「永久連線的 VPN」和「封鎖未使用 VPN 的連線」。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="Battery">
